    "detailed_description": "<h1>Subscribe to our Newsletter</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751710/extras/d504b5bae911ccd4104682aeaf72266f.avif?t=1696935147\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The first installment in Villainous Games Studio's (formerly CMD:Studio) Horror Stories Anthology Collection.\u00a0<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751710/extras/fb438ad093df36a22a51dac751b1541d.avif?t=1696935147\" /></div><br><br>You are trapped alone in a room, with only a screen giving you orders and a locked door for company. But still, you\u2019re feeling watched\u2026Is there a chance at escape if you just do what you\u2019re told?<br><br>The only way to freedom is through that locked door but there seems to be something\u2026. or someone on the other side telling you not to obey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751710/extras/dfd7a21a4c1d31521e977a3e22b83a22.webp?t=1696935147\" /></div> A dark exploration of Maslow\u2019s Hierarchy of Needs<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751710/extras/49570e7f04280a646fff1acf20b965ea.webp?t=1696935147\" /></div> An escape room you\u2019re not sure you should escape<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751710/extras/a5dc82b092086c8b2e34cfc1cd953213.webp?t=1696935147\" /></div> And the question of how far you would go if you thought there was a way out<br><br>Dive into our short chilling interactive horror experience of 15 to 20 mins to find out if you will comply!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751710/extras/edb4ccb45646c17f1e981f0ae6aecaad.avif?t=1696935147\" /></div>",
